    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili ici ecali icitungu icapeelwe ku luko lwakwa Manase, nge beli lyakwa Yosefu, kuli Makiri nao uwali ibeli lyakwa Manase kabili cikolwe ca bena Gileadi. Bapeelwe icalo ca Gileadi ne ca Bashani pa mulandu wakuti abena Makiri bali fita fyabulwi nganshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi abana abaume bambi abakwa Manase nabo bapeelwe impanga umwabela indupwa shabo: Abana bakwa Abiesa, na bakwa Heleki, na bakwa Asirieli, na bakwa Shekemu, na bakwa Heferi pamo pene na bakwa Shemida. Aba e bana baume bakwa Manase mwana Yosefu ukulingana ne ndupwa shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba Selofeadi umwana mwaume wakwa Heferi mwana Gileadi, mwana Makiri, nao uwali umwana mwaume wakwa Manase, wena takwetepo abana abaume lelo alifye na bana abanakashi beka beka. Aba bana abanakashi amashina yabo yali ni Mala, Nao, Hogila, Milika elyo na Tisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 26:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.1+NUM.27.2+NUM.27.3+NUM.27.4+NUM.27.5+NUM.27.6+NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe bonse baile kuli shimapepo Eleasa na Yoshua mwana Nuni elyo na ku ntungulushi no kuyatila, “Yawe alikonkomeshe Mose ukutupeelako icakaniko ca cishilano pamo na bandume shesu.” Eico Yoshua nao alibapeele icakaniko ca cishilano ukulinganafye na bandume shabo muli wishi umo, ukulingana ngefyo Yawe akonkomeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi abena Manase bapeelwe ifiputulwa ikumi limo ifya calo ukwabula ukubikako icalo ca Gileadi ne ca Bashani ifyabela kwishilya lya mumana wa Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu bamwana Manase abanakashi aba mu luko lwakwe balipeelweko icakaniko ca cishilano pamo ne ndume shabo. Eico kanshi icalo ca Gileadi icasheleko naco cali ca bana bambi abasheleko abakwa Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icalo cakwa Manase catampile ukufuma ku Asheri no kuya fika ku Mikimetati icali ku kabanga ka Shekemu. Umupaka walalenye ukufuma ku kapinda ka ku kuso ukuya kuminkanyako na bekashi ba mu Eni Tapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase akwete icalo ca Tapua, lelo umusumba wine uwa Tapua mu mupaka wakwa Manase wali wa bena Efulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili umupaka watwalilile ukulola ku kapinda ka kulyo ku mumana wa Kana. Uku nako kwaliko imisumba iya bena Efulemu iyashintene ne misumba ya bena Manase, lelo umupaka wa bena Manase wakonkele ku kapinda ka ku kuso aka mumana no kuya pelela kuli bemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku kapinda ka ku kulyo kwali icalo cakwa Efulemu, ku kapinda ka ku kuso nako kwali icalo cakwa Manase. Icalo cakwa Manase cashintilefye na muli bemba no kuba e mupaka pakati ka Asheri ku kapinda ka ku kuso elyo ku kabanga nako ni Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu calo cakwa Isaka na Asheri, Manase namo alikwetemo Beti Shani ne mishi yauko, Ibuleamu ne mishi yauko, abantu abaleikala mu Dori ne mishi yauko",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dori ne mishi yauko:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila, “Dori uwa ku lulamba lwa bemba.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Elyo akwete na bantu baleikala mu Eni Dori na mu mishi yauko, na baleikala mu Tana na mu mishi yauko, na ba mu Megido na mu tumishi twauko elyo no walenga itatu ni Nafoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo abena Manase balifililwe ukupoka iyi misumba, pantu abena Kenani bakoselepofye ukulaikala muli cilya calo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.27+JDG.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abap 1:27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico, ilyo abena Israeli bakosele nganshi, babikile abena Kenani kukubomba umulimo wa mulaasa. Nalyo line tababatamfishe nangu panono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo ulupwa lwakwa Yosefu baebele Yoshua abati, “Bushe cinshi watupeelela iciputulwa cimofye ica cakaniko ca cishilano panuma yakupendula? Ifwe tuli bengi nganshi kabili Yawe alitupaala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Yoshua epakubasuka ati, “Imwe nga cakuti muli bengi nganshi, ne calo cakwa Efulemu ica mu mpili naco nacicepesha kukwikalamo, imwe mufwilefye ukuya mu mutengo no kwamba ukuwamya mwe bene apakwikala mu calo ca bena Perisi na bena Refaimu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo ulupwa lwakwa Yosefu nalo lwayaswike aluti, “Awe mukwai, icalo ca mpili ifwe teti citukumane, kabili abantu bonse abena Kenani abekala mu cinika bonse balikwata amaceleta ya fyela bonse abekala mu Beti Shani na mu mishi yauko mumbali, elyo na bonse abaikala mwishika lya Yesireli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yoshua aebele aba ŋanda yakwa Yosefu ukufika ku ba ŋanda yakwa Efulemu na Manase ati, “Icine cine imwe muli bengi nganshi kabili aba maka nganshi. Tamwakakwatefye iciputulwa icapendwilwe cimo iyoo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo icalo ica mpili naco cili nokuba cenu. Nangu cabamo imiti nomba ciwamyenifye, cili nokuba icakaniko ca cishilano cenu, ukufika na ku mipaka yakutali, cikaba cenu nangufye abena Kenani bengakwata amaceleta ya fyela no kuba abakosa. Kuti mwabatamfyamo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
